* Physical AI - Experiment 6: compiled trained XOR network
* Source: models/xor_model.npz  (frozen; this file does not retrain)
* Hidden: precision ReLU. Output: linear.
* Signed weights: G+/G- paths, I_diff = I+ - I- by KCL in SPICE.
* Bias: 1 V reference through G_SCALE*|b| onto the + or - path.
* G_SCALE = 0.0001

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
Vref vref 0 DC 1

* --- neuron h1 ---
* h1 input 1 w=+1.19815674317629 w+  G = 0.000119815674317629 S  R = 8346.15342020291 Ohm
Rh1p1 in1 h1p 8533.77469518477
* h1 input 2 w=-1.50292758377884 w-  G = 0.000150292758377884 S  R = 6653.68052854338 Ohm
Rh1n2 in2 h1n 6521.32249837671
* h1 bias=-0.263318577180974 b-  G = 2.63318577180974e-05 S  R = 37976.8116137404 Ohm
Rh1bn vref h1n 36880.6089332038
Vh1p h1p 0 DC 0
Vh1n h1n 0 DC 0
Fh1p 0 h1d Vh1p 1
Fh1n h1d 0 Vh1n 1
Vh1d h1d 0 DC 0
Hh1 h1lin 0 Vh1d 10000
Bh1 h1amp 0 V = max(-15, min(15, 100000 * v(h1lin, h1y)))
Dh1 h1amp h1y Dsi
RLh1 h1y 0 10000
Eh1 h1buf 0 h1y 0 1

* --- neuron h2 ---
* h2 input 1 w=-1.32632227505072 w-  G = 0.000132632227505072 S  R = 7539.64567142449 Ohm
