Rh3bn vref h3n 26851.2282140416
Vh3p h3p 0 DC 0
Vh3n h3n 0 DC 0
Fh3p 0 h3d Vh3p 1
Fh3n h3d 0 Vh3n 1
Vh3d h3d 0 DC 0
Hh3 h3lin 0 Vh3d 10000
Bh3 h3amp 0 V = max(-15, min(15, 100000 * v(h3lin, h3y)))
Dh3 h3amp h3y Dsi
